{%- comment -%}
  RentOPC Header & Navigation v2 — Phase 3
  Mobile drawer extras (spec §4 mobile).

  Rendered inside snippets/header-drawer.liquid at the tail of
  .menu-drawer__utility-links so it inherits Dawn's drawer scroll container
  and closes with the drawer via native <details> behaviour.

  Provides:
    (a) Utility "Support" link (mirrors the desktop right-zone Support link)
    (b) Bottom-pinned "Chat with an expert on WhatsApp" panel

  Static markup only — no CMS setting dependencies (per spec: hard-coded like
  the announcement bar). Preserves ALL existing drawer content above.
{%- endcomment -%}

<div class="rop-drawer-extras" data-rop-drawer-extras>
  <a
    href="/pages/support"
    class="rop-drawer-extras__link"
    data-rop-analytics="support_click_mobile"
  >
    <span class="rop-drawer-extras__label">Support</span>
  </a>

  {%- comment -%}
    RentOPC WhatsApp deep-link — hard-coded per spec §4 (same policy as the
    static announcement bar). This is the site's existing expert-chat handle
    (currently referenced in header-group.json). If merchant changes the
    handle, edit this single string.
  {%- endcomment -%}
  <a
    href="https://wa.me/message/KFS7SMDFXRSVK1"
    class="rop-drawer-whatsapp"
    data-rop-drawer-whatsapp
    data-rop-analytics="whatsapp_expert_click"
    target="_blank"
    rel="noopener noreferrer"
  >
    <span class="rop-drawer-whatsapp__icon" aria-hidden="true">
      <svg class="rop-icon" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><use href="#rop-icon-whatsapp"/></svg>
    </span>
    <span class="rop-drawer-whatsapp__body">
      <span class="rop-drawer-whatsapp__title">Chat with an expert</span>
      <span class="rop-drawer-whatsapp__sub">Get personalised laptop rental help</span>
    </span>
  </a>
</div>
